  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Post-2015 Facilitation - UNSG&apos;s Office</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the UN Secretary General&apos;s Special Advisor Amina Mohammed&apos;s office to provide the United Nations leadership and coherence in developing and building consensus around a development framework for post-2015, ensuring that multiple efforts and contributions from various stakeholders build on each other and converge to support one consensus agenda.  The Norwegian contribution is part of pooled funding to ensure that the office has the necessary staffing and operational budgets.</narrative>
  </description>
